# The Gate C carrier's failing playtest fixture: CI requires the run to FAIL at step 2 naming line 10, and step 3
# SKIPPED (no @continue-on-fail).
@intent a failing @assert is reported as FAIL with its line, and the steps after it are skipped

@step passes
say playtest-ok
@expect chat playtest-ok within 5s

@step fails on purpose
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:ender_dragon]

@step never runs
say playtest-unreachable
